WEBVTT

00:00.540 --> 00:03.421
The world was burning

00:29.464 --> 00:35.009
The lies were loud. We were the joking tabloid

00:35.069 --> 00:35.569
crowd.

00:39.052 --> 00:45.337
We had no shelter. We had no home. Just the open

00:45.397 --> 00:50.481
road and a telephone.

00:50.641 --> 00:51.382
But you!

00:54.438 --> 01:00.183
You built a fortress. You gave us walls when we

01:00.243 --> 01:03.766
were torn. You built a place to hide from the

01:03.806 --> 01:09.031
storm. You are the iron hand. You are the shield.

01:09.051 --> 01:16.738
The only army that would not yield. This is our

01:16.878 --> 01:20.962
fortress.

01:24.077 --> 01:31.021
This isn't LA. This isn't a dream. This is a

01:31.081 --> 01:37.664
warehouse. This is a scream. We're building our

01:37.744 --> 01:43.867
truth. We're building our sound. Right here on

01:44.247 --> 01:48.970
our hallowed ground. God is you.

01:52.035 --> 01:57.778
You built a fortress. You gave us walls when we

01:57.858 --> 02:01.380
were torn. You built a place to hide from the

02:01.400 --> 02:08.724
storm. You are the iron head. You are the shield.

02:08.744 --> 02:16.529
The only army that would not yield. This is our

02:16.629 --> 02:18.510
fortress.

02:52.879 --> 02:59.283
Fortress, our home

02:59.323 --> 03:04.045
We are the fortress

